#. module: account_ux
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_ux.view_move_form
msgid ""
"Warning! This can't be undone. Deleting the number will allow you to delete "
"this invoice or to get a new number if you re-validate it. If this invoice "
"represents a voided invoice, then you should not clean it. Do you want to "
"continue?"
msgstr ""
"¡Advertencia! Esto no se puede deshacer. Eliminar el número le permitirá "
"eliminar esta factura u obtener un nuevo número si lo revalida. Si esta "
"factura representa una factura anulada, entonces no debe limpiarla. ¿Quieres "
"continuar?"

#. module: account_ux
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_ux.field_account_journal__shared_to_branches
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_ux.field_account_payment_method_line__shared_to_branches
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_ux.field_account_reconcile_model__shared_to_branches
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_ux.field_shared_to_branches_mixin__shared_to_branches
msgid ""
"Which branches of this company can use this record.\n"
"\n"
"- All branches: every company below this one, whatever its Tax ID.\n"
"- Same legal entity: only the branches that declare the same Tax ID as this "
"company, with no break in the chain. An auxiliary company with no Tax ID of "
"its own is a different legal entity and is left out.\n"
"- Not shared: only this company."
msgstr ""

#. module: account_ux
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_ux.field_account_fiscal_position__shared_to_branches
msgid ""
"Which branches this fiscal position is automatically detected in.\n"
"\n"
"- All branches: every company below this one, whatever its Tax ID.\n"
"- Same legal entity: only the branches that declare the same Tax ID as this "
"company, with no break in the chain. An auxiliary company with no Tax ID of "
"its own is a different legal entity and is left out.\n"
"- Not shared: only this company.\n"
"\n"
"Careful with how the automatic detection picks one, because it is not by "
"sequence. Odoo sorts the candidates by how deep the owning company sits in "
"the branch tree first, and only then by sequence: a position of the branch "
"you are standing in wins over one of its parent whatever the sequences say, "
"and the sequence only decides between positions of the same company.\n"
"\n"
"This scope only narrows the automatic detection. A position stays selectable "
"by hand and keeps working in the company that owns it."
msgstr ""

#. module: account_ux
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_ux/models/res_company.py:0
#: code:addons/account_ux/wizards/res_config_settings.py:0
msgid ""
"You are deactivating 'Reconcile on company currency'. Future reconciliations "
"will no longer use the company currency, which could reintroduce exchange "
"rate differences."
msgstr ""
"Estás desactivando \"Conciliar en la moneda de la compañía\". Las futuras "
"conciliaciones ya no utilizarán la moneda de la compañía, lo que podría "
"volver a introducir diferencias de tipo de cambio."

#. module: account_ux
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_ux/models/res_currency_rate.py:0
msgid ""
"You can not create a rate without company since you already have rates "
"before %s with company set. The rate you want to create will not have any "
"effect, will not be take into account."
msgstr ""
"No puede crear una cotización sin compañía ya que ya tiene cotizaciones "
"antes de %s con la compañía definida. La cotización que desee crear no "
"tendrá ningún efecto, no se tendrá en cuenta."

#. module: account_ux
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_ux/models/res_currency.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot change the rounding factor of the currency %(currencies)s.\n"
"\n"
"Changing it breaks the accounting amounts already computed with the previous "
"value. If you really need to change it, contact ADHOC so the system "
"parameter '%(param)s' is enabled on this database."
msgstr ""

#. module: account_ux
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_ux/models/account_payment.py:0
msgid "You cannot delete this payment, you should set it back to draft first."
msgstr ""
"No podés eliminar este pago; primero debés volverlo al estado borrador."

#. module: account_ux
